WEBVTT

00:02:23.550 --> 00:02:24.860
Seinoshin-sama.

00:02:27.610 --> 00:02:31.820
Your mother told me to bring you some snacks.

00:02:32.340 --> 00:02:33.710
Let me pour you some tea.

00:02:34.430 --> 00:02:36.590
Don’t lie to me, Yaichi.

00:02:39.620 --> 00:02:44.480
Mother would never do something like that for me.

00:02:45.830 --> 00:02:52.390
I wasn’t adopted by the Saegusa Family because they truly wanted me.

00:03:00.190 --> 00:03:02.060
Foolish son!

00:03:02.060 --> 00:03:04.180
You can cool off in the rain.

00:03:10.930 --> 00:03:11.880
Heiza.

00:03:18.830 --> 00:03:23.170
Seinoshin-sama is getting smarter with every passing day.

00:03:23.170 --> 00:03:25.220
He will make a good heir.

00:03:25.220 --> 00:03:27.520
The future of the Saegusa Family is saved, eh?

00:03:28.330 --> 00:03:33.080
I hope his mother will recognize it as well.

00:03:33.760 --> 00:03:34.630
Oh, yeah.

00:03:34.630 --> 00:03:39.490
He looked down when I saw him today.

00:03:46.510 --> 00:03:50.980
She told him that the scar from his burn was disgusting.

00:03:50.980 --> 00:03:52.100
She really said that?

00:03:52.960 --> 00:03:56.040
Yes, to his face.

00:03:56.400 --> 00:03:59.630
That bothered him quite a bit.

00:03:59.630 --> 00:04:04.040
He thinks that he’s not welcome, probably because of that scar.

00:04:04.470 --> 00:04:06.100
Such a relentless hag.

00:04:06.100 --> 00:04:07.040
Heiza...

00:04:07.560 --> 00:04:10.060
And what did his father say?

00:04:11.520 --> 00:04:13.040
“Leave him alone.”

00:04:16.410 --> 00:04:17.900
Seinoshin-sama.

00:04:19.280 --> 00:04:26.060
Your mother is ill, so she’s a bit unstable emotionally.

00:04:27.590 --> 00:04:30.390
Your scar has nothing to do with that.

00:04:31.900 --> 00:04:35.030
She likes beautiful things.

00:04:35.640 --> 00:04:36.960
Seinoshin-sama.

00:04:37.860 --> 00:04:38.960
Please come with me.

00:04:44.080 --> 00:04:45.340
Please look at them.

00:04:45.780 --> 00:04:48.410
They are so beautiful and captivating.

00:04:53.050 --> 00:04:55.060
Have some confidence.

00:04:55.060 --> 00:04:55.890
Confidence?

00:04:56.790 --> 00:05:01.350
Your scar has the same shape as a maple leaf, doesn’t it?

00:05:04.680 --> 00:05:05.760
Seinoshin.

00:05:07.450 --> 00:05:08.780
Still feeling down?

00:05:10.290 --> 00:05:11.840
How about sparring with me?

00:05:12.540 --> 00:05:13.270
Okay.

00:05:14.050 --> 00:05:15.270
Yaichi.

00:05:15.270 --> 00:05:16.440
Yes?

00:05:16.440 --> 00:05:18.110
Help us with the party preparations.

00:05:18.110 --> 00:05:19.750
Our Lady is pregnant.

00:05:29.060 --> 00:05:32.010
So, since they hired ronin,

00:05:32.010 --> 00:05:34.330
we should hire one as well.

00:05:34.330 --> 00:05:37.470
They cannot act recklessly.

00:05:38.710 --> 00:05:40.440
We will hire a bodyguard.

00:05:42.510 --> 00:05:44.110
Someone for show, that is.

00:05:52.580 --> 00:05:53.890
Please reconsider this!

00:05:54.900 --> 00:05:58.580
What do you mean by “you don’t have to come anymore”?

00:05:58.800 --> 00:06:03.290
As I said, starting tomorrow, you no longer need to protect me.

00:06:03.290 --> 00:06:07.450
It’s only been two days since I came here upon the employment agency’s recommendation.

00:06:07.970 --> 00:06:11.530
Do you mean you no longer need a bodyguard?

00:06:12.120 --> 00:06:16.470
Actually, they recommended a new person to us.

00:06:16.970 --> 00:06:20.390
C-C-Could you tell me the real reason?

00:06:22.870 --> 00:06:26.140
You are not reliable.

00:06:30.080 --> 00:06:33.060
What should I do with the tofu for the ronin?

00:06:33.350 --> 00:06:35.780
Seems like he has been turned down again.

00:06:35.780 --> 00:06:38.030
Shouldn’t we bring him something?

00:06:38.030 --> 00:06:40.650
Doesn’t he act strange when someone gets close to him?

00:06:40.650 --> 00:06:45.090
Anyway, the silly son of the general merchant hasn’t been around lately, has he?

00:06:45.090 --> 00:06:46.550
Really?

00:06:57.090 --> 00:06:59.420
I have no food for you.

00:07:02.640 --> 00:07:05.360
I need to find a job.

00:07:09.060 --> 00:07:11.520
I have no jobs for bodyguards.

00:07:11.790 --> 00:07:13.970
Not even one?

00:07:13.970 --> 00:07:18.030
Well, I have more than enough jobs for day laborers.

00:07:19.830 --> 00:07:22.260
I am a swordsman.

00:07:22.260 --> 00:07:25.740
I believe I told you that I don’t accept such jobs.

00:07:25.740 --> 00:07:26.990
Akitsu-sama,

00:07:27.540 --> 00:07:31.460
if you decline every job, you’ll never fill your stomach.

00:07:41.570 --> 00:07:44.090
I’m unreliable, huh?

00:08:01.050 --> 00:08:04.220
Such a beauty.

00:08:18.780 --> 00:08:22.090
Why did I dash off like a coward when I saw a yakuza...

00:08:28.960 --> 00:08:32.170
Those dumplings looked really tasty.

00:08:41.590 --> 00:08:44.990
Anything tastes good when you’re hungry.

00:08:45.830 --> 00:08:48.470
Is it really okay to treat me?

00:08:49.180 --> 00:08:50.950
Please don’t hold back.

00:08:55.070 --> 00:08:56.450
Hey...

00:08:56.450 --> 00:08:58.460
How did you become a ronin?

00:08:59.170 --> 00:09:01.540
Was your fiefdom abolished?

00:09:01.540 --> 00:09:05.250
No, my fief lord released me.

00:09:06.910 --> 00:09:10.680
Long faces don’t suit Edo.

00:09:11.430 --> 00:09:13.540
You shouldn’t brood over that.

00:09:14.470 --> 00:09:17.280
My name is Yaichi. What’s yours?

00:09:17.280 --> 00:09:20.120
Akitsu Masanosuke.

00:09:20.120 --> 00:09:23.400
The reason I’m talking to you is because I have a favor to ask.

00:09:23.400 --> 00:09:24.290
A favor?

00:09:25.090 --> 00:09:28.100
I’m looking for a bodyguard.

00:09:28.100 --> 00:09:29.340
What kind of bodyguard?

00:09:29.700 --> 00:09:32.000
I want you to protect me.

00:09:32.000 --> 00:09:35.640
I’m kind of in trouble, you know.

00:09:35.640 --> 00:09:38.560
So, I figure that I’ll need a bodyguard.

00:09:43.550 --> 00:09:46.140
Watch where the hell you’re going!

00:09:46.140 --> 00:09:47.430
S-Sorry.

00:09:47.650 --> 00:09:50.750
Sorry? You’ve got your nose up high, eh?

00:09:50.750 --> 00:09:52.900
That’s not true.

00:09:52.900 --> 00:09:55.700
This one is such a big coward.

00:09:55.700 --> 00:09:57.560
He just looks strong, eh?

00:09:57.560 --> 00:09:59.820
Are those swords for decoration?

00:10:00.910 --> 00:10:03.230
It’s true that he bumped into you.

00:10:04.990 --> 00:10:08.840
He always looks up since that’s where his goals are.

00:10:09.490 --> 00:10:13.610
Thus, he can’t see lowly ronins.

00:10:13.610 --> 00:10:14.740
What was that?

00:10:14.740 --> 00:10:16.490
Hey, let’s settle this, okay?

00:10:16.490 --> 00:10:18.240
I don’t really have any business with you.

00:10:18.240 --> 00:10:19.780
But we’ve got business with you!

00:10:20.590 --> 00:10:22.700
Why are you getting so excited?

00:10:22.700 --> 00:10:26.490
“Lowly?” That’s an insult to a swordsman!

00:10:27.220 --> 00:10:29.260
I don’t mind taking you up on a drink,

00:10:29.660 --> 00:10:31.810
but I’m not interested in stupid fights.

00:10:34.670 --> 00:10:38.190
Let’s take it easy.

00:10:55.750 --> 00:10:57.140
Yaichi-dono!

00:10:59.780 --> 00:11:00.980
Um...

00:11:02.490 --> 00:11:08.870
Could you tell me about your distress, if you don’t mind?

00:11:08.870 --> 00:11:10.510
You getting cold feet?

00:11:10.860 --> 00:11:13.100
No...

00:11:13.100 --> 00:11:15.230
Does your problem concern a woman?

00:11:15.230 --> 00:11:16.180
No.

00:11:16.630 --> 00:11:19.890
But I won’t force you to help me.

00:11:24.760 --> 00:11:26.000
What are you going to do?

00:11:29.460 --> 00:11:31.520
I agreed to take this job.

00:11:32.450 --> 00:11:34.250
I won’t go back on my word.

00:11:47.170 --> 00:11:47.930
Ume.

00:11:49.610 --> 00:11:50.560
Good night.

00:11:51.150 --> 00:11:51.750
’Night.

00:11:55.680 --> 00:11:59.350
You just treated me the whole day.

00:11:59.350 --> 00:12:00.940
Don’t worry about it.

00:12:01.170 --> 00:12:04.390
I’ll have you accompany me a bit longer.

00:12:13.270 --> 00:12:16.070
Why are we here?

00:12:16.650 --> 00:12:18.570
We’re going to meet the person I’m having trouble with.

00:12:19.690 --> 00:12:24.220
Just stand behind me and look menacing.

00:12:24.220 --> 00:12:25.490
It won’t take long.

00:12:37.430 --> 00:12:38.980
You’re from the Five Leaves, right?

00:12:45.560 --> 00:12:47.540
His bodyguards aren’t around.

00:12:47.540 --> 00:12:48.740
Be careful.

00:13:06.250 --> 00:13:08.500
It’s dangerous. Stay behind me.

00:13:21.070 --> 00:13:22.400
He’s strong!

00:13:22.400 --> 00:13:23.580
We’ll make you regret this!

00:13:23.580 --> 00:13:25.870
I didn’t cut them deeply.

00:13:26.210 --> 00:13:27.870
I’m surprised.

00:13:27.870 --> 00:13:30.270
You’re pretty strong.

00:13:30.270 --> 00:13:33.200
I have no idea why your lord released you.

00:13:33.200 --> 00:13:35.020
Please stop it!

00:13:35.020 --> 00:13:36.280
You’re embarrassing me.

00:13:37.830 --> 00:13:41.330
I-I don’t like being the center of attention.

00:13:41.670 --> 00:13:43.520
It feels awkward when people stare at me.

00:13:44.750 --> 00:13:47.750
Great. So, your problem is your personality.

00:13:58.970 --> 00:14:03.010
Isn’t this a tad different from what we agreed?

00:14:03.410 --> 00:14:04.650
You cunning bastard.

00:14:05.390 --> 00:14:06.790
I am truly sorry!

00:14:06.790 --> 00:14:08.480
It was just on a whim...

00:14:09.130 --> 00:14:10.940
I-I have the money here.

00:14:11.320 --> 00:14:15.450
I’m begging you to give me back my son. He’s my precious heir!

00:14:15.450 --> 00:14:19.250
You were reluctant about paying and even hired ronin.

00:14:19.250 --> 00:14:20.940
And now you are talking about your precious heir?

00:14:21.330 --> 00:14:23.540
Whatever. We each do things our own way.

00:14:24.010 --> 00:14:27.390
We will return your foolish son soon.

00:14:28.470 --> 00:14:29.390
Let’s go.

00:14:35.790 --> 00:14:38.250
What’s in that package?

00:14:38.650 --> 00:14:40.030
The ransom.

00:14:41.740 --> 00:14:46.110
It’s the ransom for the merchant’s son we kidnapped.

00:14:46.110 --> 00:14:48.950
I should give you a reward.

00:14:50.300 --> 00:14:54.560
Does that mean you are the villain?

00:14:55.170 --> 00:14:59.680
Yes, my job is kidnapping people.

00:15:00.330 --> 00:15:01.570
I’m a thief.

00:15:02.540 --> 00:15:05.040
I like you.

00:15:05.920 --> 00:15:08.510
I’ll have you join us.

00:15:09.050 --> 00:15:11.030
You have accepted the job.

00:15:11.620 --> 00:15:14.070
A swordsman doesn’t go back on his word, right?

00:15:23.380 --> 00:15:25.520
What should I do?

00:15:36.320 --> 00:15:38.050
Excuse me.

00:15:42.650 --> 00:15:44.610
You’re the lady from the tea house.

00:15:45.640 --> 00:15:47.580
Ichi-san has called for you.

00:15:47.580 --> 00:15:50.130
You’re one of them?

00:15:51.550 --> 00:15:55.560
Besides, I don’t remember joining you.

00:15:55.560 --> 00:15:56.860
What are you saying?

00:15:57.180 --> 00:15:59.000
You already accepted the money...

00:15:59.480 --> 00:16:01.000
and used it up, no?

00:16:04.620 --> 00:16:05.930
Oh, my.

00:16:07.300 --> 00:16:08.260
Really?

00:16:08.720 --> 00:16:11.580
Then, you didn’t touch the money?

00:16:15.520 --> 00:16:17.960
I’ve brought some rice and pickles.

00:16:21.270 --> 00:16:23.390
That guy’s one of us.

00:16:23.390 --> 00:16:25.190
His name’s Umezou.

00:16:28.430 --> 00:16:29.970
Welcome.

00:16:31.160 --> 00:16:32.640
Shall we go upstairs?

00:16:33.210 --> 00:16:34.760
We’re going upstairs.

00:16:36.160 --> 00:16:37.670
Keep it quiet then.

00:16:39.400 --> 00:16:41.170
His daughter’s sleeping.

00:16:41.780 --> 00:16:43.040
Be quiet.

00:16:45.200 --> 00:16:46.350
Sit down.

00:16:48.760 --> 00:16:51.480
You took the money,

00:16:54.440 --> 00:16:57.820
yet you’re not planning on joining us?

00:17:00.950 --> 00:17:01.670
No.

00:17:07.330 --> 00:17:10.320
Then, you’re in our way.

00:17:19.940 --> 00:17:21.340
I’m kidding.

00:17:22.130 --> 00:17:26.300
Well, I hired a bodyguard just for show.

00:17:26.730 --> 00:17:31.880
I wanted to recruit someone cowardly and kind.

00:17:33.400 --> 00:17:38.120
Just when I figured that would be impossible, I found you.

00:17:39.720 --> 00:17:41.570
Anyway, let’s hang out.

00:17:42.560 --> 00:17:46.760
I called you tonight to have a drink with me.

00:17:51.260 --> 00:17:53.150
How long are you planning on sleeping?

00:17:53.850 --> 00:17:55.150
Get up already.

00:17:58.950 --> 00:18:00.970
Shoot, I fell asleep.

00:18:02.010 --> 00:18:04.460
Sorry my dad is so annoying.

00:18:05.570 --> 00:18:08.460
Looks like Ichi-san went home last night.

00:18:09.270 --> 00:18:12.400
I didn’t know he had such a fine daughter.

00:18:12.830 --> 00:18:14.950
You can’t drink much?

00:18:14.950 --> 00:18:16.030
Yeah...

00:18:16.630 --> 00:18:19.240
So, you aren’t going to join the Five Leaves?

00:18:19.240 --> 00:18:19.870
Oh.

00:18:19.870 --> 00:18:21.880
Y-You know about them?

00:18:21.880 --> 00:18:22.400
Of course.

00:18:23.060 --> 00:18:26.870
After all, I’m the reason they came together.

00:18:32.140 --> 00:18:34.790
No job again...

00:18:51.110 --> 00:18:54.620
The daughter told me...

00:18:55.070 --> 00:18:59.700
She was treated badly by the owner’s son at the place she worked.

00:18:59.700 --> 00:19:02.280
And her father threatened the son.

00:19:02.890 --> 00:19:07.240
So, you stopped him and suggested kidnapping the son.

00:19:08.460 --> 00:19:11.250
That’s how everything started, she said.

00:19:12.450 --> 00:19:16.480
We made a lot of money and were able to get back at them easily.

00:19:17.210 --> 00:19:22.210
She added that you kidnap people from dysfunctional families occasionally.

00:19:23.220 --> 00:19:24.450
You think you’re gallant?

00:19:24.450 --> 00:19:28.720
I’m not doing anything good at all.

00:19:29.980 --> 00:19:33.040
Do you really want to become a samurai?

00:19:33.670 --> 00:19:36.240
How about forgetting that and becoming a merchant?

00:19:36.240 --> 00:19:37.620
It’s much more fun.

00:19:37.620 --> 00:19:39.140
Well...

00:19:39.740 --> 00:19:42.120
I’ve got this problem with my personality.

00:19:42.120 --> 00:19:46.860
That’s why I came to Edo: to get myself in shape and then serve as a samurai again.

00:19:47.190 --> 00:19:50.460
That might sound boring to you, though.

00:19:51.180 --> 00:19:53.980
I just want to live my own way.

00:19:54.580 --> 00:19:56.790
I’m not going to preach.

00:19:57.020 --> 00:20:00.790
But I really admire...

00:20:01.220 --> 00:20:03.330
how lax you are.

00:20:05.760 --> 00:20:09.460
I sent the money to my family in my hometown.

00:20:09.460 --> 00:20:12.100
My brother got himself into debt.

00:20:12.100 --> 00:20:15.850
Even though I was dragged into it,

00:20:15.850 --> 00:20:19.520
I see a grim future for our family if he gets dismissed as well.

00:20:19.730 --> 00:20:21.370
That’s a boring story.

00:20:21.370 --> 00:20:21.940
Huh?

00:20:22.890 --> 00:20:26.940
Why did you talk to me about your family’s issues?

00:20:30.730 --> 00:20:35.300
Why don’t you work for us if you need money?

00:20:37.600 --> 00:20:39.700
Just think about it.

00:20:39.700 --> 00:20:41.380
Take your time.

00:20:41.380 --> 00:20:42.420
That’s it...

00:20:44.060 --> 00:20:46.380
Your composure...

00:20:46.900 --> 00:20:49.830
I want to smile like you.

00:20:50.620 --> 00:20:54.650
You can if you want.

00:21:08.940 --> 00:21:16.140
I’ve got a feeling that something was hidden

00:21:16.140 --> 00:21:25.430
in the words you once told me. Those words cross my mind again and again.

00:21:25.430 --> 00:21:33.850
Yet your voice always sounds the same as before.

00:21:33.850 --> 00:21:40.900
Every time I breathe, I wanna hold you in my arms

00:21:41.300 --> 00:21:49.830
Every words you whispered makes my heart beat up and high

00:21:50.670 --> 00:21:57.910
Every time I breathe, I just wanna hold you in my arms again

00:21:59.030 --> 00:22:06.730
Every words you whispered makes my heart beat up and high

00:22:07.390 --> 00:22:14.970
Every day I need you  All the time I'll be there for you

00:22:15.700 --> 00:22:24.080
Every words you whispered makes my heart beat up and high

00:22:30.370 --> 00:22:33.200
Next time on House of Five Leaves:

00:22:33.640 --> 00:22:34.690
Yaichi here.

00:22:35.150 --> 00:22:39.110
Well, I’m acting all cool, but the real cool one is the winter of Edo.

00:22:39.360 --> 00:22:42.410
Just between us, I really need a bellyband and long underwear.

00:22:42.410 --> 00:22:46.490
Oh, and disregard what others say. Ume’s place is really warm.

00:22:46.490 --> 00:22:48.010
Well then, the next episode’s title is:

00:22:48.010 --> 00:22:49.930
“Make Love to Me.”
